hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22","[AI-translation] Usaid bin Hudeer se riwayat hai, unhone farmaya: Ek raat jab woh Soorat-ul-Baqarah padh rahe the aur un ka ghoda un ke paas baandha hua tha, achanak ghoda chhilaya. Woh chup ho gaye to ghoda bhi chup ho gaya. Phir padhne lage to ghoda chhilaya. Woh chup ho gaye aur ghoda bhi chup ho gaya. Phir padhne lage to ghoda chhilaya. Woh wapas aa gaye kyunke un ka beta Yahya us ke qareeb tha aur unhe dar tha ke kahin ghoda use na ruch de. Jab unhone use hata liya to unhone asmaan ki taraf sar uthaya to nazar hi nahi aane lagi. Subah jab hui to unhone Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko ye waqiya bataya. Aap ne farmaya: ""Padho, ay Ibn-e-Hudeer! Padho, ay Ibn-e-Hudeer!"" Unhone arz kiya: Ay Rasoolullah! Mujhe dar tha ke Yahya ko ruch de aur woh us ke qareeb tha, isliye maine sar uthaya, us ki taraf mutawajjo hua, phir maine asmaan ki taraf sar uthaya to dekha ke ek chhat si jis mein chiragh jaisi cheezein theen, phir woh nikal gayi yahan tak ke main us ko na dekh saka. Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum jante ho woh kya tha?"" Unhone kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh farishte the jo tumhari awaz par nazdik aaye the. Agar tum padhte to subah tak log unhein dekhte aur woh un se na chhupte."" Ibn-e-Haad ne kaha: Aur mujhe ye hadees Abdullah bin Khabbab ne Abu Saeed Khudri se, unhone Usaid bin Hudeer se riwayat kar ke sunayi."
"23","[AI-translation] Zaid se riwayat hai ke unhone Abu Salam ko kehte hue suna, unhone kaha: Mujhe Abu Umamah Bahili ne hadess bayan ki. Unhone kaha: Maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: ""Quran parho, beshak woh qayamat ke din apne ashab ke liye shafaat karega. Az-Zahrawayn parho, Al-Baqarah aur Soorat Aal-e-Imran, kyunke woh qayamat ke din aisi aayengi jaise do badal, ya jaise do andhere ki chhatain, ya jaise paron ko phailaye hue parindon ke do jhund apne ashab ki taraf se bahas karte hue. Soorat-ul-Baqarah parho, kyunke isey padhna barkat hai aur chhodna hasrat hai, aur Batala ise qaaboo nahi pa sakte."
"24","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Nafeer ne farmaya: Maine Nawwas bin Sam'an Kilaabi ko kehte hue suna: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko farmate hue suna: ""Qayamat ke din Quran aur us ke ahl, jin hone is par amal kiya karte the, laye jayenge. Soorat-ul-Baqarah aur Aal-e-Imran un ki peshgi karenge."" Un ke liye Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne teen misaalein bayan farmaayi jin hein mein baad mein kabhi nahi bhoola. Aap ne farmaya: ""Jaise do badal, ya do siyah chhataan jin ke darmiyan roshni (sharaq) ho, ya jaise paron ko phailaye hue parindon ke do jhund apne sahib ki taraf se bahas karte hue."
"25","[AI-translation] Allah ka sab se azeem naam jis se pukara jaye to woh jawab deta hai; wo Quran ki teen suraton mein hai: Al-Baqarah, Aal-e-Imran, aur Ta-Ha mein."
